  "instructions": [
    "Heat the olive oil in the ttukbaegi earthenware pot over medium heat.",
    "Add the chopped onion and cook until softened, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add the lamb pieces and cook until browned on all sides, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add the chopped carrots and potatoes, and cook for an additional 2 minutes.",
    "Add the chopped Thai sweet basil, salt, and black pepper, and stir to combine.",
    "Add the water to the pot and bring to a boil.",
    "Reduce the heat to low and simmer, covered, for 1.5 hours, or until the lamb is tender.",
    "Serve the stew hot, garnished with additional Thai sweet basil if desired."
